  "item_short_desc": "<p>Gear up for the demands of duty with Rothco&rsquo;s Firefighter / EMS Quarter Zip Job Shirt. Engineered for versatility and utility, this work shirt features multiple compartments including 2 pen pocket slits, a 2-depth hook-and-loop fastened chest pocket, and 2 front hand warmer pockets, providing ample space for storing on-the-job essentials. Mic clips on each shoulder offer convenient access to communication devices, ensuring seamless communication during critical moments.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "4",
  "description": "<p>Gear up for the demands of duty with Rothco&rsquo;s Firefighter / EMS Quarter Zip Job Shirt. Engineered for versatility and utility, this work shirt features multiple compartments including 2 pen pocket slits, a 2-depth hook-and-loop fastened chest pocket, and 2 front hand warmer pockets, providing ample space for storing on-the-job essentials. Mic clips on each shoulder offer convenient access to communication devices, ensuring seamless communication during critical moments. Reinforced elbows and forearms enhance durability, guaranteeing a long-lasting first-responder uniform that can withstand the rigors of the job for years to come. The quarter zip pullover design with a no-roll collar supports a competent, professional appearance that inspires confidence and composure while on duty. Additionally, the warm soft fleece lining ensures comfort and warmth during shifts, making this shirt an essential piece of gear for firefighters and EMS personnel.</p>",
